 # The DevTools Times
 
-This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
-
+A sample news application built with Astro, React and Tailwind CSS.
 
 ```sh
-pnpm install && pnpm run start
+pnpm install
+pnpm build
+pnpm start
 ```
 
-The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
+Open `http://localhost:11224/devtools-times/`. Use `pnpm dev` for local development; production uses HTTPS and secure cookies.
+
+Browsing does not initialize a session. Saving an article creates a temporary, anonymous reading list with a 24-hour retention limit. Visitors can export or delete it from the privacy page. Accounts, analytics and advertising integrations are disabled pending vendor review. Editorial images are hosted locally and the site uses system fonts.
 
-## Tech Stack
+```sh
+pnpm build
+pnpm test
+pnpm audit:dependencies
+```
 
