-- **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
-- **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
-- **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+Tests exercise the production server without opening a browser. See [the service register and audit process](docs/privacy-audits.md) for independent audit requirements, hosting responsibilities and process-local session storage limitations.
